1
00:00:00,095 --> 00:00:02,935
(Raj:)Sure, I sit on the floor
for years, no one cares.

2
00:00:03,032 --> 00:00:04,302
(Raj:)The pretty white girl's
there ten seconds,

3
00:00:04,466 --> 00:00:06,636
(Raj:)and suddenly we're
all running to IKEA.

4
00:00:08,103 --> 00:00:09,813
(Sheldon:)No one is running anywhere.

5
00:00:09,972 --> 00:00:11,782
(Sheldon:)We're not getting
a dining room table.

6
00:00:11,941 --> 00:00:14,651
(Leonard:)I know you don't like change,
but it's not a terrible idea.

7
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:16,410
(Penny:)You guys never use
that space up there.

8
00:00:16,579 --> 00:00:17,579
(Penny:)Why not get a table?

9
00:00:17,746 --> 00:00:19,656
(Sheldon:)Do you want the long answer
or the short answer?

10
00:00:19,815 --> 00:00:21,765
(Howard:)How come we never get that option?

11
00:00:23,385 --> 00:00:26,995
(Sheldon:)Chaos theory suggests that
even in a deterministic system,

12
00:00:27,156 --> 00:00:30,106
(Sheldon:)if the equations describing
its behavior are nonlinear,

13
00:00:30,259 --> 00:00:32,329
(Sheldon:)a tiny change
in the initial conditions

14
00:00:32,494 --> 00:00:35,634
(Sheldon:)can lead to a cataclysmic
and unpredictable result.

15
00:00:36,131 --> 00:00:37,131
(Penny:)Translation?

16
00:00:37,299 --> 00:00:43,019
Wah! I don't want a table!

